  <item>
    <title>原来荔枝有600多种！茶味、汽水味、巨型荔枝【荔枝季品鉴指南】</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a17074fac7bdb080c31bc02</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a17074fac7bdb080c31bc02</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 27 May 2026 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>吃了20多年的荔枝，竟然还没入门？和【</span><strong><span>广东荔枝协会】理事</span></strong><span>@锋哥，聊了下</span><strong><span>荔枝的品种、储藏技巧、大小年</span></strong><span>。从入门的</span><em><span>妃子笑</span></em><span>，到冷门的“茶味”</span><em><span>玲珑</span></em><span>，再到偏门的“</span><em><span>砸死牛</span></em><span>”……</span></p><p><span>听完你会发现，荔枝比想象中好玩多了！也希望能帮你在荔枝季吃得更好～</span></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJiiyc0upBjY_V7QnYlDNe22bBz.jpg"></figure><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="440">07:20</a> 荔枝起源云南？以后1月到8月都能吃到？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="484">08:04</a> 我们最推荐的荔枝：仙进奉、观音绿、白糖罂</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="961">16:01</a> 鉴定网络热门品种：挂绿、桂味、妃子笑</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1425">23:45</a> 小众宝藏：玲珑带茶香，御金球像水豆腐，仙桃荔比鸡蛋大</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1406">23:26</a> 偏门荔枝：“蟑螂”荔枝、“砸死牛”荔枝</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2459">40:59</a> 荔枝大小年是怎么回事？今年能吃上吗？</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2931">48:51</a> 怎么判断荔枝里是否有虫？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3065">51:05</a> 如何判断荔枝是否微死？以及保鲜秘诀</span><br></p><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个水果爱好者社群，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。目前已经有8000+群友购买过，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><p><strong><span>如果你也想吃到不踩坑的好水果，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></strong></p><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure><p></p>]]></description>
