  <item>
    <title>十万个水果冷知识！人类的口欲、水果的套路</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/69d69b4be2c8be3155b8483c</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">69d69b4be2c8be3155b8483c</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 08 Apr 2026 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>像生物学家一样吃水果，可能无用，但非常有趣！</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期和《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6437cc4566e4c00c6aff2c46" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6437cc4566e4c00c6aff2c46"><span>生物漫游指南</span></a><span>》串台，聊一聊46亿年的协同进化史中，动物、人类、水果之前有哪些好玩的冷知识</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJiiyc0upBjY_V7QnYlDNe22bBz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>一、种子想旅行，果肉是路费</span></strong><br><span> <a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="103">01:43</a> 果实是“不能动的植物”给“能动的动物”发出的跑腿委托</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>二、动物和植物，是怎么互相“套路”的</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="232">03:52</a> 果实大小，决定了谁来吃</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="530">08:50</a> 味觉：我们是怎么感知出“酸甜苦辣”的</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1699">28:19</a> 视觉：是如何帮我们找到果子的？</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2303">38:23</a> 嗅觉：榴莲的臭、酒的香 = 好吃的果子</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3675">01:01:15</a> 专属快递：我的果，其他物种都不能吃！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>三、相爱相杀：吃水果有时也不开心</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4018">01:06:58</a> 涩味：我怎么被水果“攻击”了！</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4596">01:16:36</a> 过敏：有时“不能吃”比“好吃”更重要</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>四、人类的反击：我们是怎么改造水果的</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4954">01:22:34</a> 改造吃法：吃成了厨神，克服了毒素</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5130">01:25:30</a> 改造基因：我想要，我得到</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>附：节目里提到的一些图片资料</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>左图是人眼中的“黑鸟”，右图是能看到紫外线的鸟眼中的“斑斓鸟”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuQIhGL0NISeUS8ejuJC4d8AufSn.png"></figure><span></span><p><span>同为十字花科，嫁接后上面长包菜，下面长萝卜的“萝包”</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FmbW-Gu35tcck_TfnUMcuqGLoEKl.png"></figure><span></span><h2><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个水果爱好者社群，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。目前已经有8000+群友购买过，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>如果你也想吃到不踩坑的好水果，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></strong></em></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
