    <guid isPermaLink="false">69c2ae53798af9b984efc748</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 24 Mar 2026 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>315鸡爪事件之后，我们又开始担心：每天吃的肉，还能放心吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期我们想弄明白，</span><strong><span>餐桌上的猪肉</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>我们请来了两位很懂猪肉的人：猪场二代@猪哥，和厨子朋友@</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a794725227c40b3013f2d4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a794725227c40b3013f2d4"><span>家减成厨</span></a><span>的铁皮鸭。</span><strong><span>一个从源头聊起，一个从餐桌聊开</span></strong><span>，希望能帮你理清：</span><strong><span>猪肉安不安全？怎么买？怎么吃？</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FqJiiyc0upBjY_V7QnYlDNe22bBz.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>Part1 食品安全：这些恐慌，是真是假？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="265">04:25</a> 抗生素残留，到底该不该担心？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="830">13:50</a> 解冻后化了一滩水，是注水肉吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1081">18:01</a> 淋巴肉，会偷偷混进你的餐桌吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1450">24:10</a> 肉类零食，更有可能是劣质肉</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part2 选购指南：白猪、土猪、黑猪，差在哪？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2511">41:51</a> 到底什么才算真的土猪、黑猪？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2677">44:37</a> 土猪更好吃，原因是什么？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3106">51:46</a> 普通人，有必要加钱买更好的肉吗？</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part3 购买渠道：菜市场、超市、网购，去哪买更好？</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3188">53:08</a> 超市的“冷鲜肉”，冷链管理决定一切</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3317">55:17</a> 菜市场的“热鲜肉”，为什么一定要早上去？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3891">01:04:51</a> 网购的“冷冻肉”，冻过就一定不好吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span>*附：提到的杨光建的视频</span><a href="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ni2PBMEmm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d045ede24b767a182344ace1ef891532" data-url="https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1Ni2PBMEmm/?spm_id_from=333.337.search-card.all.click&amp;vd_source=d045ede24b767a182344ace1ef891532"><span>《解构猪肉，理解各部位的区别和做法》</span></a></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part4 动物福利：工业化养殖的🐷也可以有“猪权”</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4467">01:14:27</a> 杂食者的两难：好吃，可以不那么残忍吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="5129">01:25:29</a> &nbsp;吃肉的人聊动物福利，是伪善吗</span></p><span></span><p><span>* 本期嘉宾猪哥的微博/小红书@猪场严选</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个水果爱好者社群，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。目前已经有8000+群友购买过，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想吃到不踩坑的好水果，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
