    <title>苹果才不是无聊的水果！吃腻了的苹果最近为何重回顶流？</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/691ee4046018cc2c98c60c31</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">691ee4046018cc2c98c60c31</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 23 Nov 2025 22:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>苹果最近突然在小红书翻红，这个天天见的水果，其实有着许多陌生但精彩的故事</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目我们和美食播客</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62ee22c34ea7a3b9ea4929a5" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/62ee22c34ea7a3b9ea4929a5"><span>《七分饱》</span></a><span>一起，打包了关于苹果有趣的历史八卦、硬核的品鉴知识，以及简单易学的食谱；保证让你听完后，再看手里的苹果，眼神都不一样了。</span></p><span></span><p><em><strong><span>*如果你喜欢吃水果，也欢迎从底部加入我们的水果群🍊</span></strong></em></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="120">02:00</a> 热搜话题的诞生：苹果才不是无聊的水果！</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FrrWie_TpZa09T40PM4LOJluxJO6.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="370">06:10</a> 历史：成为水果前，苹果的真实身份是什么</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="630">10:30</a> 苹果的扬名：谚语“一天一苹果”从何而来？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1022">17:02</a> 文化梗王：从伊甸园到纽约、硅谷、艺术节</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1950">32:30</a> 中国版：从传教士到红富士，洋苹果的本土化</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2391">39:51</a> 冷知识：关于苹果，3个反常识真相</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3020">50:20</a> 推荐4种苹果：居然还有香蕉味和花香调？</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpU-h-LRHT-wEXRiAWzMpcF5eMWx.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3671">61:11</a> 苹果调饮：奶茶品牌谁上谁火的流量密码</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="4241">70:41</a> 苹果做菜：花式吃果！简单易学的食谱来了！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个水果爱好者社群，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。目前已经有5000+群友购买过，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>如果你也想吃到不踩坑的好水果，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
