  <item>
    <title>E.18 秋天的第一口甜，该留给哪种水果？丨9月水果指南</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68bdbbee5faf3686597fde2b</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68bdbbee5faf3686597fde2b</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 07 Sep 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>九月正值夏秋之交，夏果还未完全退场，秋季的C位选手已经跃跃欲试。</span><br><span>在这场“抢鲜”大战里，到底谁能拔得头筹，成为你秋天的第一口甜？</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，让我们用一手试吃经验告诉你，九月有哪些水果值得体验。</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：说起秋天，最有代表性的水果</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="92">01:32</a> 秋月梨，光是削皮都会飚汁，秋天润燥太合适</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="321">05:21</a> 翠香猕猴桃，其实选对国产品种，佳沛金果真的不香了</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="542">09:02</a> 猕猴桃一直放不软？做对了其实只需要3-5天</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：早一步入秋的新疆产区</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="862">14:22</a> 新疆恐龙蛋，存在早采，选购时擦亮眼睛</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="971">16:11</a> 法兰西西梅，通便界王者，最快15分钟见效</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1184">19:44</a> 海棠果，像是浓缩一整颗苹果的风味</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1223">20:23</a> 库尔勒香梨，摸起来油油的，原来不是打了蜡</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1285">21:25</a> 山西隰县的玉露香梨，青出于蓝，比库尔勒更好吃</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 3：虽然全年都有，但是九月之后最好吃</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1356">22:36</a> 番茄，长得越慢越好吃的一类水果</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1402">23:22</a> 人参果，熟的像蜜瓜，不熟的像黄瓜</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1626">27:06</a> 进口牛油果需要运气，云南孟连的颗颗好吃</span></p><span></span><p><span>Part 4：</span><strong><span>夏天夏天悄悄过去，这几款水果不要错过</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 枣油桃，录播客的时候还在，发的时候已经不在</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1842">30:42</a> 金秋红蜜，给全年的桃子画上完美句号</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1912">31:52</a> 粉红恋人芒果，每年必吃的两款芒果之一，肉厚还细腻</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2062">34:22</a> 网纹蜜瓜，在日本买不起，在中国吃不够</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 5：重点之外，其他值得提一提的水果</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2235">37:15</a> 无花果，好吃难运，好运难吃</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2287">38:07</a> 突尼斯软籽石榴，还是有籽，但是能咽</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2316">38:36</a> 咔咔脆黄桃，脆到咔咔响</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2359">39:19</a> 大荔冬枣，好吃的冬枣原来在秋季</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 6：最后</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2440">40:40</a> 欢迎加入我们的水果社群，一起探索水果的更多乐趣</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个</span><strong><span>水果爱好者社群</span></strong><span>，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。</span><strong><span>目前已经有4000+群友购买过</span></strong><span>，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想吃到</span><strong><span>不踩坑的好水果</span></strong><span>，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
