  <item>
    <title>E.17 水果刺客别想刺我！推荐7款今年的小众宝藏水果！</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/68a590e042cc2798e785c24e</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">68a590e042cc2798e785c24e</guid>
    <pubDate>Wed, 20 Aug 2025 23:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>稀奇古怪的水果越来越多，想尝鲜又怕买到</span><strong><span>「刺客」</span></strong><span>？这期我们串台了</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6888d0defce32aa67669d197" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6888d0defce32aa67669d197"><span>《见多食广See&amp;Savor》</span></a><span>，一起聊聊那些</span><strong><span>「冷门又惊艳」</span></strong><span>的宝藏水果！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 1：用心挖掘，小众水果也可以很宝藏！</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="225">03:45</a> 稀奇古怪水果越来越多了？原因揭秘</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="480">08:00</a> 新鲜莲蓬也能吃？全国不一样的吃果习俗</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="594">09:54</a> 物流奇迹！四川小樱桃和海南红毛丹的千里漂流</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1284">21:24</a> 决战桃子之巅的「奶油蟠桃」，为何不同果园间风味悬殊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1764">29:24</a> 天府黄金甲！水果新品种是怎么研发出来的</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>Part 2：小众水果想要出道，取了艺名还得卷</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2306">38:26</a> 开挂的新疆产地，为什么有水果叫「恐龙蛋」啊</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2697">44:57</a> 还得是奶茶！广东的「黄皮、油柑」顺利出道</span><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2923">48:43</a> 珍惜每一个荔枝大年，碰上了一定要吃够！</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个</span><strong><span>水果研选社群</span></strong><span>，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。目前</span><strong><span>已经有4000+群友购买过</span></strong><span>，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想吃到</span><strong><span>不踩坑的好水果</span></strong><span>，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><strong><span>【🎙️本期嘉宾】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>葵葵chanchan ，食品专业本科，大厂离职后重回食品行业。爱吃管不住嘴，爱做饭不爱洗碗，热爱各类运动，生活在上海的广州人。</span></p><span></span><p><span>🌍</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6888d0defce32aa67669d197" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/6888d0defce32aa67669d197"><span>《见多食广See&amp;Savor》</span></a><span>是一档专注探寻</span><strong><span>小众、新鲜、好吃、有趣</span></strong><span>的饮食产品的栏目。</span></p><span></span><p><span>👉在这里，你或许会听到常见或小众食物的前世今生、漫游在地方小吃/饮食文化里、谈谈热门饮食趋势、对话食品行业人员，聊聊食物是怎么做出来的、他们和食物之间的故事、其中的奥秘与内幕等等</span></p>]]></description>
