  <item>
    <title>E.16 每个人心中，都有一个家乡的桃子宇宙</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6878be05a12f9ff06aa1a9ed</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6878be05a12f9ff06aa1a9ed</guid>
    <pubDate>Thu, 17 Jul 2025 09:13:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>如果搜索“中国哪里的桃子最好吃”，你会看到各地的朋友都在为家乡的桃子呐喊：</span></p><span></span><p><span>江苏ip会说，</span><strong><span>阳山的水蜜桃</span></strong><span>堪比琼浆玉液。成都ip则坚持：</span><strong><span>龙泉驿的桃子</span></strong><span>才是天下第一</span></p><span></span><p><span>中国是桃子的原产地，好吃的桃子实在太多，似乎每个人心中，都有一个</span><strong><span>自己家乡的桃子宇宙</span></strong><span>。</span></p><span></span><p><span>这期节目，我们邀请了美食播客《</span><a href="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a794725227c40b3013f2d4" data-url="https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/podcast/67a794725227c40b3013f2d4"><span>家减成厨</span></a><span>》的主播“铁皮鸭”，一起来探索</span><strong><span>中国人的味觉ip</span></strong><span>，也重新认识这颗夏日里最可爱的水果🍑</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【part 1：中国人的桃子宇宙】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="138">02:18</a> 茫茫水果，为何我们独宠桃子？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="706">11:46</a> 中国人的食桃史</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1021">17:01</a> 可脆可软、可圆可扁，桃子的品种为何辣么多？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1437">23:57</a> 国外怎么吃桃子？美国、欧洲、日本的食桃差异</span></p><span></span><p><span>德国超市的桃子👇</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvtRHs_e5reR9_zRXRJoeI6jeMP5.jpg"></figure><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2083">34:43</a> 从餐桌到影院，谈谈桃子背后的文化符号</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2450">40:50</a> 大盘点！从6月到10月，有哪些惊艳的桃</span></p><span></span><h2><strong><span>【part 2：除了直接吃，解锁更多桃子的美味打开方式】</span></strong></h2><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3055">50:55</a> 掌握了水果入菜，我也是个做饭天才</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>【喜欢吃水果🍊的听友请上车】</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span>曾经在乡下做过一段时间农业的我们，建了一个</span><strong><span>水果研选社群</span></strong><span>，每周我们都会和群友们一起试吃测评。</span><strong><span>目前已经有4000+群友购买过</span></strong><span>，反馈都非常不错！</span></p><span></span><p><span>如果你也想吃到</span><strong><span>不踩坑的好水果</span></strong><span>，欢迎添加小助手微信：lingdanyanxuan</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FniEknEjtZ_GdzqynOHXNSeWfB4o.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpED8BnqqxFo56ITF4A4K98hv-CJ.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtCmcIgTlhHMd1usAubNYtRXwK-x.png"></figure><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvVCnLlBRPAS-cdhW0X7F02tkoQd.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
